Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:11.21,Annotation,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,848)}{\an7\bord0.5\3c&HA1CCB3&\be20\shad0\2a&HFF&{\k5\ko5}技{\k5\ko5}能{\k5\ko5}<{\k5\ko5}回{\k5\ko5}避{\k5\ko5}L{\k5\ko5}V{\k5\ko5}1{\k5\ko5}→{\k5\ko5}L{\k5\ko5}V{\k5\ko5}2{\k5\ko5}>
